    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Two GPU numbers, and why both are here\n\n**Visible** is what the driver reports on this machine. **Schedulable** is what a Pod can actually be given. On this host they read **2** and **0**, and both are true: Docker here has no `nvidia` container runtime, so no device reaches a k3d node and the cluster advertises `nvidia.com/gpu: 0` (ADR 0008).\n\nA dashboard showing only one of them would mislead whichever one it chose \u2014 either \"we have two GPUs\" (nothing can use them) or \"we have no GPUs\" (they are in the machine, and the utilisation graphs below are real). Installing a device plugin changes the second number and nothing else here."
      },
      "transparent": false
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU \u2014 allocatable, and what AshML has committed",
      "description": "Committed means the sum of the CPU *requests* of jobs AshML placed on this node and has not seen finish \u2014 the number the scheduler admits against. It is not usage: what the containers actually consumed is in the cAdvisor row at the bottom, and the gap between the two rows is the whole of \"is this workload sized right\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto"
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ashml_node_cpu_cores",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} \u00b7 allocatable",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "ashml-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ashml_node_cpu_allocated",
          "legendFormat": "{{node}} \u00b7 committed",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
